{"id":"8fc59f225acaad5e2aa901b6628682404165124b","url":"https://alloyhtml.com/example.html","title":"Ledger, an Alloy CSS example","site_name":"Zeli","source":"Hacker News · 24h最热","byline":null,"excerpt":"One page of a made-up invoicing app, built with Alloy CSS and no JavaScript.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n\n        <!-- Page heading -->\n        <div>\n            <h2>Invoices</h2>\n            <p>24 invoices in the last 90 days</p>\n          </div>\n\n        <!-- Numbers -->\n        <div>\n          <div>\n              <p>Outstanding</p>\n              <p>$18,240</p>\n              <p>12 invoices</p>\n            </div>\n          <div>\n              <p>Overdue</p>\n              <p>$4,860</p>\n              <p>3 invoices</p>\n            </div>\n          <div>\n              <p>Paid in November</p>\n              <p>$32,410</p>\n              <p>18% more than October</p>\n            </div>\n          <div>\n              <p>Time to get paid</p>\n              <p>11 days</p>\n              <p>2 days faster than October</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- A banner whose button picks the Overdue tab below: a label for its radio. -->\n        <div>\n          <p><b>3 invoices are overdue</b>, $4,860 in total. A friendly reminder usually does it.</p>\n          <p><label for=\"tab-overdue\">Review them</label>\n        </p></div>\n\n        <!-- The invoices: tabs over four lists. -->\n        <div>\n          <p><label>All <span>24</span></label>\n            <label>Overdue <span>3</span></label>\n            <label>Paid <span>10</span></label>\n            <label>Drafts <span>2</span></label>\n          </p>\n\n          <!-- All. Ticking a row swaps the toolbar for the bulk actions. -->\n          <div>\n            \n            <p><span>Selected invoices</span>\n              \n              \n            </p>\n\n            <table role=\"table\" aria-label=\"All invoices\">\n              <thead role=\"rowgroup\">\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\"><span>Select</span></th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Invoice</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Client</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Due</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Status</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Amount</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\"><span>Actions</span></th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody role=\"rowgroup\">\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><label><i></i></label></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0149</a><span>Nov 15</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Okafor Legal</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\">Nov 29</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Status\"><span>Draft</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$950.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><span>\n                    \n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Download INV-0149\"></a>\n                  </span></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><label><i></i></label></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0148</a><span>Nov 14</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Tidewater Coffee</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\">Nov 28</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Status\"><span>Draft</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$1,250.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><span>\n                    \n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Download INV-0148\"></a>\n                  </span></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><label><i></i></label></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0147</a><span>Nov 12</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Lumen Architects</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\">Nov 26</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Status\"><span>Sent</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$4,800.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><span>\n                    \n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Download INV-0147\"></a>\n                  </span></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><label><i></i></label></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0146</a><span>Nov 10</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Brightline Studio</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\">Nov 24</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Status\"><span>Opened</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$2,340.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><span>\n                    \n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Download INV-0146\"></a>\n                  </span></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><label><i></i></label></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0145</a><span>Nov 3</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Okafor Legal</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\">Nov 17</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Status\"><span>Paid</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$3,600.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><span>\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Receipt for INV-0145\"></a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Download INV-0145\"></a>\n                  </span></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><label><i></i></label></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0144</a><span>Oct 28</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Harbor &amp; Pine</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\"><span><span>Nov 11</span> <span>5 days late</span></span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Status\"><span>Overdue</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$1,980.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><span>\n                    \n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Download INV-0144\"></a>\n                  </span></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><label><i></i></label></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0143</a><span>Oct 24</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Northfield Clinic</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\"><span><span>Nov 7</span> <span>9 days late</span></span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Status\"><span>Overdue</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$2,150.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><span>\n                    \n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Download INV-0143\"></a>\n                  </span></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><label><i></i></label></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0142</a><span>Oct 20</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Vega Logistics</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\">Nov 3</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Status\"><span>Paid</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$6,400.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><span>\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Receipt for INV-0142\"></a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Download INV-0142\"></a>\n                  </span></td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <div>\n              <p><span>1 to 8 of 24</span></p><nav aria-label=\"Pages\">\n                <span aria-disabled=\"true\">Previous</span>\n                <a href=\"#\">Next</a>\n              </nav>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Overdue -->\n          <div>\n            <table role=\"table\" aria-label=\"Overdue invoices\">\n              <thead role=\"rowgroup\">\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Invoice</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Client</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Due</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Amount</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\"><span>Actions</span></th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody role=\"rowgroup\">\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0144</a><span>Oct 28</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Harbor &amp; Pine</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\"><span><span>Nov 11</span> <span>5 days late</span></span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$1,980.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0143</a><span>Oct 24</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Northfield Clinic</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\"><span><span>Nov 7</span> <span>9 days late</span></span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$2,150.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0141</a><span>Oct 15</span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Marlow Books</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Due\"><span><span>Oct 29</span> <span>18 days late</span></span></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$730.00</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\"></td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p><span>3 overdue, $4,860.00 in total</span>\n              \n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Paid -->\n          <div>\n            <table role=\"table\" aria-label=\"Paid invoices\">\n              <thead role=\"rowgroup\">\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Invoice</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Client</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Paid on</th>\n                  <th role=\"columnheader\">Amount</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody role=\"rowgroup\">\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0145</a></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Okafor Legal</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Paid on\">Nov 11, by card</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$3,600.00</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0140</a></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Brightline Studio</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Paid on\">Nov 9, bank transfer</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$2,900.00</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0139</a></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Tidewater Coffee</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Paid on\">Nov 6, by card</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$1,100.00</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\">\n                  <td role=\"cell\"><a href=\"#\">INV-0142</a></td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Client\">Vega Logistics</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\" data-label=\"Paid on\">Nov 2, bank transfer</td>\n                  <td role=\"cell\">$6,400.00</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p><span>1 to 4 of 10</span>\n              <a href=\"#\">Next</a>\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Drafts -->\n          <div>\n              <p>2 drafts waiting</p>\n              <p>INV-0149 for Okafor Legal and INV-0148 for Tidewater Coffee, $2,200.00 together.</p>\n              </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Two side panels -->\n        <div>\n          <section aria-labelledby=\"top-clients\">\n              <div>\n                <h2 id=\"top-clients\">Top clients</h2>\n                <p><span>Last 90 days</span>\n              </p></div>\n              <div>\n                <div>\n                  <p><span>Lumen Architects</span><span>$14,200</span></p>\n                  \n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <p><span>Vega Logistics</span><span>$12,800</span></p>\n                  \n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <p><span>Okafor Legal</span><span>$9,450</span></p>\n                  \n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <p><span>Brightline Studio</span><span>$7,540</span></p>\n                  \n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n          <section aria-labelledby=\"activity\">\n              <h2 id=\"activity\">Recent activity</h2>\n              <ul>\n                <li>\n                  <span></span>\n                  <span>Okafor Legal paid INV-0145<span>$3,600.00 by card</span></span>\n                  <span>Nov 11</span>\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                  <span></span>\n                  <span>Brightline Studio opened INV-0146<span>Twice, from an email</span></span>\n                  <span>Nov 12</span>\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                  <span></span>\n                  <span>You sent INV-0147 to Lumen Architects<span>$4,800.00, due Nov 26</span></span>\n                  <span>Nov 12</span>\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                  <span></span>\n                  <span>INV-0144 is overdue<span>Harbor &amp; Pine, $1,980.00</span></span>\n                  <span>Nov 12</span>\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Questions: an accordion. -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"questions\">\n          <h2 id=\"questions\">Questions</h2>\n          <details name=\"faq\">\n            <summary>\n              <span>When does a client get a reminder on their own?</span>\n              \n            </summary>\n            <p>Three days before the due date, on the day, and every seven days after. Change it in Settings.</p>\n          </details>\n          <details name=\"faq\">\n            <summary>\n              <span>Can a client pay part of an invoice?</span>\n              \n            </summary>\n            <p>Yes. The invoice stays open, showing what's left, until the rest arrives.</p>\n          </details>\n        </section>\n\n        <p>\n          Ledger is a made-up app. This page is one HTML file with <a href=\"https://github.com/alloyhtml/css\">Alloy CSS</a> and no JavaScript.\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/alloyhtml/css/blob/master/example.html\">See its source</a>.\n        </p>\n      </div></DIV>","content_text":"Invoices 24 invoices in the last 90 days Outstanding $18,240 12 invoices Overdue $4,860 3 invoices Paid in November $32,410 18% more than October Time to get paid 11 days 2 days faster than October 3 invoices are overdue, $4,860 in total. A friendly reminder usually does it. Review them All 24 Over